        - "A realtime voice session opens with this step: talk and read the replies here, or ask it to change the text color."
        - "Tap or pinch: Gemini answers on the left, Imagen paints the image on the right and Lyria plays a short music track."
        - "A Gemini Live session opens with this step: talk and read the replies here, or ask it to change the text color."
